play":"DASS-Y 21"},{"system":"http://fhir.openmrs.org/core/StructureDefinition/omrs-form","code":"dacc6483-52ff-33b0-8fad-f51863c6f946","display":"DASS-Y 21"}],"item":[{"extension":[{"url":"@h/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"@q/","code":"page","display":"Page"}],"text":"Page"}}],"linkId":"page-dass-y","type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"section-dass-y","text":"DASS-Y 21","type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"assessment-timeframe-instructions","text":"We would like to find out how you have been feeling in THE PAST WEEK. There are some sentences below. Please select the statement which best shows how TRUE each sentence was of you during the past week. There are no right or wrong answers.","text:i18n":{"fr":"Instructions : Nous aimerions savoir comment vous vous êtes senti(e) AU COURS DE LA SEMAINE ÉCOULÉE. Vous trouverez ci-dessous plusieurs phrases. Veuillez sélectionner l'affirmation qui indique le mieux à quel point chaque phrase correspondait à votre situation au cours de la semaine écoulée. Il n'y a pas de bonnes ou de mauvaises réponses.","es":"Instrucciones: Nos gustaría saber cómo te has sentido DURANTE LA SEMANA PASADA. A continuación, encontrarás una serie de frases. Por favor, selecciona la opción que mejor indique hasta qué punto cada frase ha sido VERDADERA en tu caso durante la semana pasada. No hay respuestas correctas ni incorrectas.","ru":"Мы хотели бы узнать, как вы себя чувствовали В ТЕЧЕНИЕ ПРОШЛОЙ НЕДЕЛИ. Ниже приведены утверждения. Пожалуйста, выберите вариант, который лучше всего отражает, насколько КАЖДОЕ утверждение соответствовало вашей ситуации на прошлой неделе. Здесь нет правильных или неправильных ответов.","ar":"0 = إذا كانت العبارة غير صحيحة على الإطلاق في حالتك (خلال الأسبوع الماضي) | 1 = إذا كانت العبارة صحيحة قليلاً في حالتك | 2 = إذا كانت العبارة صحيحة إلى حد ما في حالتك | 3 = إذا كانت العبارة صحيحة تماماً في حالتك"},"type":"display"},{"linkId":"frequency-rating-scale-instructions","text":"0 = If the statement was NOT TRUE of you (in the past week) | 1 = If the statement was A LITTLE TRUE of you | 2 = If the statement was FAIRLY TRUE of you | 3 = If the statement was VERY TRUE of you","text:i18n":{"fr":"0 = Si l'affirmation n'était PAS VRAIE dans votre cas (au cours de la semaine écoulée) | 1 = Si l'affirmation était UN PEU VRAIE dans votre cas | 2 = Si l'affirmation était ASSEZ VRAIE dans votre cas | 3 = Si l'affirmation était TRÈS VRAIE dans votre cas","es":"0 = Si la afirmación NO FUE VERDADERA en su caso (durante la semana pasada) | 1 = Si la afirmación fue UN POCO VERDADERA en su caso | 2 = Si la afirmación fue BASTANTE VERDADERA en su caso | 3 = Si la afirmación fue MUY VERDADERA en su caso","ru":"Шкала оценки выглядит следующим образом: 0 = Никогда | 1 = Иногда | 2 = Часто | 3 = Почти всегда","ar":"مقياس التقييم هو كما يلي: 0 = أبداً | 1 = أحياناً | 2 = غالباً | 3 = دائماً تقريباً"},"type":"display"},{"extension":[{"url":"@h/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"@q/","code":"dateTime"}]}}],"linkId":"encounter-encounterDate","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.valueDateTime","text":"Encounter Date","text:i18n":{"fr":"Date de la consultation","ar":"تاريخ اللقاء","ru":"Дата встречи","es":"Fecha de Encuentro"},"type":"date","required":true},{"extension":[{"url":"@s/sdc-questionnaire-itemExtractionContext","valueExpression":{"name":"q1","language":"application/x-fhir-query","expression":"Observation"}}],"linkId":"q1-group","type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"q1-inner-group","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.valueCodeableConcept","type":"group","item":[{"extension":[{"url":"@h/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"@q/","code":"radio-button","display":"Radio Button"}]}},{"url":"@s/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression","valueExpression":{"language":"text/fhirpath","expression":"%observations.entry.resource.ofType(Observation).where(code.coding.code = '5db4ffff-7f87-47ed-838a-e9d4224b70b1').value.coding.first()"}},{"url":"@h/questionnaire-choiceOrientation","valueCode":"horizontal"}],"linkId":"q1","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.valueCodeableConcept.coding","prefix":"1. ","text":"I got upset about little things","text:i18n":{"fr":"Je me suis fâché(e) pour des choses insignifiantes","ar":"شعرت بالانزعاج من أشياء بسيطة","ru":"Я расстроился из-за мелочей","es":"Me molesté por cosas pequeñas"},"type":"choice","answerOption":[{"valueCoding":{"code":"b95f6a5d-78ae-4f59-9fcf-d18e01196028","display":"0"}},{"valueCoding":{"code":"b95f6a5d-78ae-4f59-9fcf-d18e01186010","display":"1"}},{"valueCoding":{"code":"b95f6a5d-78ae-4f59-9fcf-d18e01186011","display":"2"}},{"valueCoding":{"code":"b95f6a5d-78ae-4f59-9fcf-d18e01186012","display":"3"}}]}]},{"extension":[{"url":"@h/questionnaire-hidden","valueBoolean":true}],"linkId":"q1-obs","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.code","type":"choice","initial":[{"valueCoding":{"code":"5db4ffff-7f87-47ed-838a-e9d4224b70b1","display":"I got upset about little things"}}]}]},{"extension":[{"url":"@s/sdc-questionnaire-itemExtractionContext","valueExpression":{"name":"q2","language":"application/x-fhir-query","expression":"Observation"}}],"linkId":"q2-group","type":"group","item":[{"linkId":"q2-inner-group","definition":"http://hl7.org/fhir/StructureDefinition/Observation#Observation.valueCodeableConcept","type":"group","item":[{"extension":[{"url":"@h/questionnaire-itemControl","valueCodeableConcept":{"coding":[{"system":"@q/","code":"radio-button","display":"Radio Button"}]}},{"url":"@s/sdc-questionnaire-initialExpression","valueExpression":{"language":"text/fhirpath","expression":"%observations.entry.resource.ofType(Observation).where(code.coding.code = 'ca45915c-fa29-4074-b69e-07ae2ccf6905').value.coding.first()"}},{"url":"@h/questionnaire-choiceOrientation","valueCod